			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.
There are various things to be implemented.
a. Taking input as an integer (steps 1 and 3)
b. Creating new variables (step 2)
c. Check if a number is odd or even (steps 4, 5 and 6)
d. Displaying output (step 9)
e. Repeating the check for one number at a time

We have discussed a, b, c and d in previous assignments multiple times.</attribute>
